== Usage ==

# Select the versioned set matching the actual project.
# Add relevant shared workflows and use core workflows only for core contributions.
# Copy complete skill directories with their scripts, references and assets to the project's skill library.
# Read SKILL.md and the referenced resources before use.

For Codex, project skills use .agents/skills/. Shared/core workflows can use the global skill library. Load only one version copy of each skill name. The target checkout's instructions and APIs determine compatibility. Skill changes are tracked through Git history.

